==History==
2023
*The Ice Spirit's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 4/12/2023, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/12/2023)|December 2023 Update.]]
*On 13/12/2023, the [[Version History#Tower Troop Update (13/12/2023)|Tower Troop Update]], decreased the cycles required to 2 (from 3).
2024
*On 5/3/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Ice Spirit's area radius to 2 tiles (from 1.5 tiles).
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved Ice Spirit after death.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], added a 48% damage boost to the Evolved Ice Spirit, but removed the third Ice Blast.
*On 3/6/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2025)|Balance Update]], removed the Evolved Ice Spirit's damage boost.
*On 8/7/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Ice Spirit's freeze duration to 1.1 seconds (from 1.2 seconds).
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Ice Spirit's hitpoints by 6%

